    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# AI-Powered Customer Feedback Pipeline\n\nOwned By: Inna Siliaieva\nLast Updated: 22 September 2026\n\nFetches customer feedback from the n8n Academy API,\nclassifies each feedback item using AI with structured output,\nand generates a tailored customer-service reply.\n\n## Flow\n\n1. TriggerManual\n   Starts the workflow manually.\n\n2. GetFeedback\n   Fetches customer feedback items from the n8n Academy API.\n\n3. SetFeedbackItem\n   Limits the input to the feedback item selected for processing.\n\n4. ClassifyFeedback\n   Uses AI to classify:\n   - sentiment\n   - topic\n   - urgency\n   - key issue\n\n5. OutputParser\n   Converts and validates the AI result as structured output.\n\n6. SetClassificationResult\n   Prepares the original feedback and classification fields\n   for the reply-generation step.\n\n7. GenerateReply\n   Generates a customer-service reply using the feedback\n   and its classification.\n\n8. SendGeneratedReply\n   Sends the final result to the Academy assessment endpoint.\n\n## AI Models\n\n- Classification: openai/gpt-oss-20b via Groq\n- Reply generation: openai/gpt-oss-120b via Groq\n\n## Reliability\n\n- Structured Output Parser is used for predictable output.\n- Retry on Fail is enabled for the classification step.\n\n## Dependencies\n\n- n8n Academy API Key credential\n- Groq API credential\n- n8n Academy Assessment ID\n\n## Skills Practiced\n\n- HTTP Request authentication\n- AI provider credentials\n- Basic LLM Chain\n- Prompt engineering\n- Structured Output Parser\n- Structured JSON output\n- AI classification\n- AI-generated customer replies\n- Retry on failure\n\n"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
